:: Apartment Hallway
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-hallway", "Garden South Street — Apartment Hallway")>>\
You are in the hallway outside of your apartment.

<<icon "apartment-door">><<link "Enter Apartment <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Apartment Living Room">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<actionIcon "stairs-up">><<link "Take the stairs up <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway Upper">><</link>>
<<actionIcon "stairs-down">><<link "Take the stairs down <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway Lower">><</link>>

:: Apartment Hallway Upper
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "xavier">>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-hallway-upper", "Garden South Street — Upper Hallway")>>\
You are in the hallway on the floor above your apartment. <<Xavier>> lives on this floor.

<<icon "apartment-door">><<link `"Knock on " + LoveInterests.displayName("xavier") + "'s door"`>><<goto "Xavier Door Knock">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<actionIcon "stairs-down">><<link "Take the stairs down <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway">><</link>>

:: Xavier Door Knock
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "xavier">>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-hallway-upper", "Garden South Street — Upper Hallway")>>\
You knock on <<Xavier>>'s door. Looks like <<he>> isn't home right now.

<<link "Step back">><<goto "Apartment Hallway Upper">><</link>>

:: Apartment Hallway Lower
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isOlder()>><<goto "Garden South Street">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("apartment-hallway-lower", "Garden South Street — Lower Hallway")>>\
You are in the front lobby of your apartment complex.

<<actionIcon "stairs-up">><<link "Take the stairs up <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Apartment Hallway">><</link>>
<<icon "apartment-ml-door">><<link "Leave Apartment Complex">><<goto "Garden South Street">><</link>>
